{"answer_text":"Deal management has consolidated around a few strong products. The ones getting the most attention this year:\n\n### Top picks\n\n1. **Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud** — excellent forecasting and territory tools, but setup usually needs a dedicated admin.\n2. **Halcyon Sales** — solid pipeline views with built-in calling; the reporting needs some setup.\n3. **Sheetly** — a sheet can track deals, but nothing reminds you to follow up.\n\n**Bottom line:** Pick Northwind CRM for breadth, or Halcyon Sales if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50e6-70c0-8127-ef97d3d3ac85","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0109,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:38.350Z","engine":"chatgpt","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["deal management software reviews"],"latency_ms":6800,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[131,144],[451,464]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[254,267],[481,494]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889f843f0cde","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Sheetly","name_text":"Sheetly","offsets":[[353,360]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"negative","sentiment_reason":"Described mainly through its problems."}],"model":"gpt-6-luna",